       ]
     ] [
       fhir:url [ fhir:v "http://hl7.org/fhir/5.0/StructureDefinition/extension-Requirements.statement.requirement"^^xsd:anyURI ] ;
       fhir:value [
         a fhir:markdown ;
         fhir:v "Record consent as a FHIR Consent resource that documents\n* the data subject(VHL Holder)\n* The purpose of use\n* The authorized data recipients (i.e., permitted VHL Receivers)\n* The scope of data (e.g., specific documents or resource types)\n* The duration or validity period of the consent"
